        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Australian Women's Weekly, Godey's Lady's Book, Fresh with the Australian Women's Weekly\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group\n- Places: Sydney, Philadelphia, Australia, United States\n- People: Lyndey Milan\n- Roles: Food Director, co-host\n\nFacts:\n- Godey's Lady's Book was a United States women's magazine published in Philadelphia from 1830 to 1878.\n- The Australian Women's Weekly is an Australian monthly women's magazine published by Bauer Media Group in Sydney.\n- Lyndey Milan was the Food Director for The Australian Women's Weekly.\n- Lyndey Milan was a co-host on the Channel 9 show Fresh with the Australian Women's Weekly.",
